# Component List

## Common Components (`src/components/common`)
- `Navbar`: Role-aware navigation.
- `Footer`: Branding and important links.
- `LeaderboardTable`: Shared leaderboard component used in Public and Admin views.
- `StatusBadge`: Colorful badges for Round Status, Payment Status, etc.
- `CountdownTimer`: Real-time clock for deadlines.

## Participant Components (`src/components/participant`)
- `TeamStatsCard`: Displays team name, members, and current ranking.
- `SubmissionForm`: Input for PPT, GitHub, and Deployment links with validation.
- `GitHubValidator`: Real-time GitHub repo existence check via API.
- `PaymentUpload`: Interface to upload UPI payment screenshots.

## Admin Components (`src/components/admin`)
- `TeamManager`: Table with filters (verified, round 1, etc.) and action buttons.
- `PaymentReviewModal`: View screenshot and approve/reject payment.
- `RoundController`: Global switches to lock/unlock rounds or change status.
- `ScoreOverride`: Manual adjustment tool for scores.
- `CSVExporter`: Tool to download team data.

## Judge Components (`src/components/judge`)
- `ScoringPanel`: Input form for evaluation criteria (Innovation, Technical, etc.).
- `SubmissionPreview`: Embedded viewer or links to team deliverables.
- `AssignedTeamsList`: List of teams assigned to the judge for the current round.

## Pages
- `LandingPage`: The public face of the hackathon.
- `AuthPage`: Register/Login with Firestore role initialization.
- `ParticipantDashboard`: Main hub for teams.
- `AdminDashboard`: Command center for organizers.
- `JudgeDashboard`: Scoring interface for experts.
- `LeaderboardPage`: Public real-time standings.
